<title>UK: CESC sets $70 million 10-year FRN, call, put.</title>
<headline>CESC sets $70 million 10-year FRN, call, put.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager ANZ Investment Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CALCUTTA ELECTRIC SUPPLY CORP LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $70 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY ** 06.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     150 BP    PAY DATE    06.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100	 FULL FEES   75 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    100</p>
<p>NOTES  **  CALL AND PUT AT PAR IN 2004  </p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  INDIA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
